 H_{\mathrm{cert}}-c=\frac{11143720283677}{76055000000000}>0,
 \qquad b'(R)=\frac{189(H_{\mathrm{cert}}-c)}{(189-R)^2}>0,
$$
故
$$
 b(R)>
 \frac{12989968756585329951614851353741208000}
 {19292583841513304535245437992719689361}
